# Do not use `-dt`

This product is **Loremetry**. Never use `-dt` in app names, binary names, bundle ids, database filenames, window titles, comments, or docs.

The older desktop SQLite file `loremetry.db` stays untouched. This app uses `loremetry-app.db` in the same config folder.
